Map data
HSA facility and station density on 1 January 2019, from public data only (CMS facilities, the Dartmouth crosswalk and ACS population), joined to the 2015 eye-exam benchmark.


Click to show/hide R Code
# HSA facility and station density on 1 January of the map year, from public
# data only: CMS facilities (usRds), Dartmouth crosswalk, ACS population.
map_year &lt;- max(study_years)
